import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 422 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Nüwa Faction Analysis: Limitations of Gift-Style Order","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 422 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Nüwa Faction Analysis: Limitations of Gift-Style Order","no":422,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Nüwa","Nüwa Faction","Gift-Style Order","Limitations"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","261-Tang-Luo Enlightened-Predator Verdict","05-Myriad-Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0422_模块2-莽荒纪-女娲阵营分析-恩赐式秩序的局限.md","filePath":"en/0422_模块2-莽荒纪-女娲阵营分析-恩赐式秩序的局限.md"}'),s={name:"en/0422_模块2-莽荒纪-女娲阵营分析-恩赐式秩序的局限.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,g,h){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-422-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-nuwa-faction-analysis-limitations-of-gift-style-order" tabindex="-1">Entry 422 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Nüwa Faction Analysis: Limitations of Gift-Style Order <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-422-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-nuwa-faction-analysis-limitations-of-gift-style-order" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 422 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Nüwa Faction Analysis: Limitations of Gift-Style Order&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 27) | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 261, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-god-who-made-humans-still-only-raises-them-as-children" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the god who made humans still only raises them as children <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-god-who-made-humans-still-only-raises-them-as-children" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the god who made humans still only raises them as children&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six top-level axioms take the republican axiom of Myriad Races as bottom line. Manghuang&#39;s world&#39;s &quot;Nüwa faction&quot; represents an order — creating humans, protecting humans, gifting humans, but essentially still <strong>gift-style order</strong>: all beings are children Nüwa made; order is bestowed by Nüwa; beings live dependent on Nüwa. This is isomorphic to Tang Luo&#39;s gift-style civilization. This entry analyzes this order&#39;s goodwill and limitations. The law-first axiom is core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Nüwa faction&#39;s energy waste lies in &quot;over-doing&quot;: Nüwa and faction Great Experts take disasters for all beings, legislate for them, decide for them; beings&#39; growth subjectivity long deprived. <strong>The stronger the god, the weaker the people — this is gift-style order&#39;s deepest energy mismatch.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gift-style order&#39;s regression logic:</p><ol><li><strong>Dependency cultivated</strong>: beings accustomed to god-protection; once god withdraws, beings lack self-rescue ability</li><li><strong>Subjectivity atrophied</strong>: long arranged; beings lose the ability to legislate themselves, decide themselves</li><li><strong>God dies = vacuum</strong>: once Nüwa faction falls in battle, beings cannot even maintain order themselves</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind gift-style order is &quot;doing-for-you&quot;-style implicit predation:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;I do this for your own good&quot;</strong>: Nüwa makes and protects humans; the goodwill is real, but takes beings&#39; subjectivity into herself</li><li><strong>Order bestowed by god</strong>: beings do not participate in legislation; they are only beneficiaries</li><li><strong>The gentlest predation</strong>: making people accustomed to being arranged is harder to resist than direct grabbing — because it is wrapped in grace</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Nüwa Gift-Style Order</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Order</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>God legislates for beings</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build; beings legislate themselves</td></tr><tr><td>God wards off disasters for beings</td><td>Alaya supervision + institutional construction; beings have self-rescue ability</td></tr><tr><td>Beings depend on god</td><td>Law anchors rights universal-benefited to all</td></tr><tr><td>God dies = vacuum</td><td>Network-style civilization; god absent runs as usual</td></tr><tr><td>Order hangs on god&#39;s goodwill</td><td>Order hangs on institutions and law</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Nüwa gift-style order vs. symbiotic order two models</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: uniformly inject &quot;Nüwa faction withdraws&quot; shock</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: beings&#39; self-rescue rate, order-maintenance duration, Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity development</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the gift model beings&#39; self-rescue rate extremely low; withdrawal = chaos; under the symbiotic model beings have their own order; withdrawal does not affect operation</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Nüwa faction self-consistency: medium</strong>. Its &quot;make-and-protect&quot; logic internally self-consistent, but conflicts with late inflated cosmos model</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Nüwa faction&#39;s position redrawn in multi-book linkage</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high at faction level</strong>. Order hangs on Nüwa faction&#39;s goodwill</li></ul><p>Nüwa faction&#39;s grace also has a deeper problem: it makes beings treat god&#39;s existence as taken-for-granted infrastructure. Beings no longer think about what to do if god is gone, because Nüwa is always there. This psychological dependency is harder to treat than any institutional flaw — it is not giving beings a suboptimal order, but making beings lose the ability to imagine their own order. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not a stronger Nüwa, but Myriad Ranks who, when Nüwa is gone, can overnight build their own council.</p><p>Nüwa faction&#39;s grace also has a paradox: the stronger the god, the weaker the beings; the weaker the beings, the more afraid the god is to let go. This is a self-reinforcing loop. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to break is precisely this loop — let beings get strong, so god can truly retire.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: god over-does; beings&#39; subjectivity atrophies</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: &quot;doing-for-you&quot; is the gentle predation of taking beings&#39; subjectivity into god</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Nüwa faction = gift-style (high), isomorphic to Tang Luo; god does people&#39;s work, people never grow up</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: grace only reaches &quot;those god made&quot;; Myriad-Ranks offshoots may not be included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: gift order lacks cross-plane institutional resilience</li></ul><p>Nüwa faction&#39;s grace also has an overlooked cost: it makes Nüwa herself tired. A god who bears all beings&#39; karmic retribution essentially transfers Myriad Ranks&#39; growth cost entirely onto herself. The stronger the god, the weaker the beings; the weaker the beings, the more the god cannot let go. This is a lose-lose loop. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is to let Myriad Ranks grow their own abilities; god can instead retire. True compassion is making beings no longer need compassion.</p><p>The day god retires is the day beings truly grow up. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ultimate goal is raising a Myriad Races that no longer needs god — this sounds paradoxical, but is gift-style order&#39;s only exit.</p><p>God can be great, but great to the point of walking for beings is beings&#39; misfortune.</p><p>Letting Myriad Ranks stand on their own is true compassion.</p><p>Letting beings no longer need god is god&#39;s purpose of existence.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Nüwa&#39;s goodwill is real, but goodwill cannot solve &quot;children raised never grow up.&quot; What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not a stronger Nüwa, but letting Myriad Ranks themselves learn not to depend on Nüwa. Gift-style order&#39;s ceiling is clear — god present = peace, god gone = chaos; symbiotic order&#39;s goal is making Myriad Ranks themselves become gods.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · Nüwa faction analysis · limitations of gift-style order described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./421_模块2-莽荒纪-吞天大法设定-掠夺式修炼的莽荒版.html">Entry 421 · Heavens-Devouring Great Law</a> · <a href="./423_模块2-莽荒纪-无间阵营分析-掠夺派的极端形态.html">Entry 423 · Nether Faction Analysis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{u as __pageData,m as default};
